From 77426c5bc5bd47dcc25dac3214b78087e79e12f9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Van Tran <tetcu@fgorg.vn>
Date: Tue, 10 Nov 2026 15:50:37 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/11] feat(decisions): structured decisions on issues

Table issue_decision (add-only, no foreign keys): a question, 2-8 options
(at most one recommended), due date, who asked (member or agent), and the
answer. API: list/create on an issue, answer (people only) and cancel,
plus GET /api/issues/decisions/open for the workspace. Waiting is enforced by
the workflow gate; clients post the answer as a comment so the usual
triggers wake the agent. Workspace deletion removes decisions.

Patch-Id: decisions
